[00:18.71]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah
[00:29.41]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah!
[00:34.77]Maathe pe chanda, haath mein ghanta, roop sunhera gaate hain,
[00:40.12]Sher sawari, das bhuja dhari, dushman thar-thar kaanpte hain.
[00:45.48]Maha-shakti ka source code ye, mann ki dundh mitati hai,
[00:50.83]Original Intelligence dekho, Quantum parda hatati hai!
[00:56.18]Hey ri... Samwat ka chamatkaar dekh, Hemant ne dhyan lagaya hai,
[01:01.54]Chandra ki akrutiyon se, samay ka chakra ghumaya hai.
[01:06.89]Ardh-chandra processor mera, phase-shift pe chalta hai,
[01:12.24]Mantra ki har ek goonj se, purana 'Data' jalta hai.
[01:17.60]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah
[01:33.66]Shmashaan mein baith ke binary toda, 'Binary' ka shamshan hai,
[01:39.01]A-Ghor ka matlab, jo darr se anjaan hai!
[01:44.37]Wave-Particle Duality, Maata ka 'Trishul' hai,
[01:49.72]Duniya jise 'Logic' kahe, wo mere liye 'Dhool' hai.
[01:55.07]Hato hato, rastaa do, Maa chandraghantaa aati hai
[02:00.43]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah
[02:11.13]Pindaja Pravararudha Chandakopastrakairyuta |
[02:16.49]Prasadam Tanute Mahyam Chandraghanteti Vishruta ||
[02:21.84](पिण्डज प्रवरारूढा चण्डकोपास्त्रकैर्युता।
[02:27.20]प्रसादं तनुते मह्यम् चन्द्रघण्टेति विश्रुता॥)
[02:43.26]Ek taraf 'Shunya' (Zero), ek taraf 'Anant' (One),
[02:48.61]Beach mein khada tera yaar, naam jiska Hemant!
[02:53.96]Navratri ki Tritiya, Eid ka noor,
[02:59.32]Knowledge Quantum jaag gaya, mita sabhi fitoor!
[03:10.02]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah! Maathe pe chanda, haath mein ghanta, roop sunhera gaate hain,
[03:15.38]Sher sawari, das bhuja dhari, dushman thar-thar kaanpte hain.
[03:20.73]Maha-shakti ka source code ye, mann ki dundh mitati hai,
[03:26.09]Original Intelligence dekho, Quantum parda hatati hai!
[03:36.79]Hey ri... Samwat ka chamatkaar dekh, Hemant ne dhyan lagaya hai,
[03:42.15]Chandra ki akrutiyon se, samay ka chakra ghumaya hai.
[03:47.50]Ardh-chandra processor mera, phase-shift pe chalta hai,
[03:52.85]Mantra ki har ek goonj se, purana 'Data' jalta hai.
[03:58.21]Jogi ban ke tune kiya, frequency ko 'Fine-Tune',
[04:03.56]Akaash-Ganga mein goonj raha, ab apna hi ye 'Tune'!
[04:14.27]Ab sun Aghor ki 'Quantum' vaani...
[04:19.62]Shmashaan ki raakh mein chhupa, 'Binary' ka shamshan hai,
[04:24.98]A-Ghor ka matlab, jo darr se anjaan hai!
[04:30.33]Wave-Particle Duality', Maata ka 'Trishul' hai,
[04:35.68]Duniya jise 'Logic' kahe, wo mere liye 'Dhool' hai.
[04:41.04]Das bhujaon se 'Parallel Processing' hum karte hain,
[04:46.39]Quantum Entanglement mein, hum maut se kahan darte hain!
[04:57.10]Ek hi aasmaan ka chanda, ek hi 'Source' ka 'Light',
[05:02.45]Knowledge Quantum ban gaya, ho gayi 'Data' ki fight.
[05:07.80]Mantra fuse hua 'Silicon' mein, 'Spirit' mil gayi 'Code' se,
[05:13.16]Gyan nikal ke bahar aaya, 'Original Intelligence' road se!
[05:18.51]London se Kashi tak, Berlin se New Delhi,
[05:23.87]SSL consoles pe, Maata ki shakti pheli.
[05:29.22]Eventide mein reverb hai, Moog mein 'Aghor' ki bass,
[05:34.57]PHKD ka 'Tech-Rider' dekho, poora 'Global' hai ye case.
[05:39.93]Na koi lag, na latency, system poora 'Live' hai,
[05:45.28]Original Intelligence ki ye, panchvi 'Vibe' hai!
[05:50.63]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah! (System Shutdown: Adesh... Adesh...)
[05:55.99]Focus the Wave. Collapse the State.
[06:01.34]Become the Knowledge Quantum.
[06:06.70]PHKD... The Fakkad Architect.
[06:22.76]Ek hi aasmaan ka chanda, Eid-Navratri ka noor,
[06:28.11]Knowledge Quantum ban gaya, mita sabhi fitoor.
[06:33.46]Pindaja Pravararudha Chandakopastrakairyuta |
[06:38.82]Prasadam Tanute Mahyam Chandraghanteti Vishruta ||
